  "steps": [
    "Heat 2 tbsp of the olive oil in a large deep skillet with a lid over medium-high heat. Brown the sausage about 8 min, stirring now and then. If your sausage is raw, cook it to 165°F.",
    "Add the remaining 1 tbsp oil, the orzo and the garlic. Stir 1 min to toast the orzo.",
    "Add the broth, coconut milk, dried herbs, red pepper flakes, salt and pepper. Bring to a boil, then cover, lower the heat, and simmer 10 min, stirring once or twice, until the orzo is tender and most of the liquid is absorbed.",
    "Stir in the spinach a handful at a time until wilted, then stir in the Parmesan. Taste for salt and serve with basil."
  ],
